nuxt/nuxt","homepage":"https://nuxt.com","size":136934,"stargazers_count":59808,"watchers_count":59808,"language":"TypeScript","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":false,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":5553,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":913,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"has_pull_requests":true,"pull_request_creation_policy":"all","topics":["csr","framework","full-stack","hacktoberfest","hybrid","node","nuxt","server-rendering","ssg","ssr","static-site-generator","universal","vue"],"visibility":"public","forks":5553,"open_issues":913,"watchers":59808,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"### Environment\r\n\r\n- Operating System: `Linux`\r\n- Node Version:     `v16.15.0`\r\n- Nuxt Version:     `3.0.0-rc.11`\r\n- Nitro Version:    `0.5.4`\r\n- Package Manager:  `npm@8.5.5`\r\n- Builder:          `vite`\r\n- User Config:      `-`\r\n- Runtime Modules:  `-`\r\n- Build Modules:    `-`\r\n\r\n### Reproduction\r\n\r\n```ts\r\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\r\nimport { computed } from 'vue';\r\n\r\n// ...\r\n\r\ndebugger;\r\nconst result = computed(() => processor(props.input));\r\n</script>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThen run with debugger, and step into `computed()` function, you will see the `isInSSRComponentSetup` variable is set to `false` on the server.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2821574/193991243-c4fe0260-9bec-4326-8a25-535006209e46.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Describe the bug\r\n\r\nNuxt 3 SSR is not setting the `isInSSRComponentSetup` variable to `true` on the server, that used in the `computed()` function, see:\r\n\r\n* https://github.com/vuejs/core/commit/f4f0966b33863ac0fca6a20cf9e8ddfbb311ae87\r\n* https://github.com/vuejs/core/issues/5208\r\n\r\n\r\n#### Temporary fix\r\n\r\n```ts\r\n<script setup lang=\"ts\">\r\n// Importing original `computed()` function with three arguments, to use latest, the `isSSR`\r\n// eslint-disable-next-line vue/prefer-import-from-vue\r\nimport { computed } from '@vue/reactivity';\r\n\r\n// ...\r\n\r\n// eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/ban-ts-comment\r\n// @ts-ignore\r\nconst result = computed(() => processor(props.input), undefined, process.server);\r\n</script>\r\n```\r\n\r\n### Additional context\r\n\r\n#### Memory consumption\r\n\r\nProduction build of an application, 60 requests per second, 10 minutes of load (36 000 requests).\r\n\r\n##### Before fixes\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2821574/193991955-11f1ea36-93d2-4e2a-b44e-0c07058911f0.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n##### After fixes\r\n\r\nIncludes fix from https://github.com/nuxt/nuxt.js/issues/15093.\r\n\r\n![image](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2821574/193992122-dbf4ddc2-7cf4-4fed-ab1f-1fa657f11a0f.png)\r\n\r\n#### Memory difference\r\n\r\n##### Flame graph\r\n\r\n![image_2022-10-04_22-44-30](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2821574/193992686-a0f009aa-5940-4eed-86d5-4b747206239f.png)\r\n\r\n##### Table\r\n\r\n![image_2022-10-04_22-42-43](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/2821574/193992594-c9b3d86a-060c-4974-ac84-831c0a6c7421.png)\r\n\r\n\r\n### Logs\r\n\r\n_No response_","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nuxt/nuxt/issues/15095/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nuxt/nuxt/issues/15095/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"id":10556875422,"node_id":"LOE_lADOCCum185BOlzSzwAAAAJ1PSKe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/vuejs/core/issues/events/10556875422","actor":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"